# Use your own cover image

Use a photograph or a design of your own instead of the cover SEED.html makes.

1. Click the [Book]{.ui} tab, then [Cover]{.ui}.
2. Click [Use my own image…]{.ui} and choose the image file.

The cover changes at once. The previews beside it show how it looks on a shelf and in a reading app's list.

Make the image taller than it is wide, with the title large enough to read at a small size. A JPEG or PNG about 1600 pixels tall is a good size.
